<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss Re has no comment on Ebner remark.</title>
<headline>Swiss Re has no comment on Ebner remark.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Reinsurance declined to comment on financier Martin Ebner's assertion that Swiss Re held a stake of at least five percent in Wintherthur Insurance.</p>
<p>&quot;For the moment we will not comment on this remark because generally we do not give information about Swiss Re's share purchases,&quot; a company spokesman told Reuters.</p>
<p>He said he hoped Swiss Re or Winterthur would comment on the remark, based on a letter Ebner said he received from Winterthur, before the Swiss Exchange opens.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
